1
00:00:01,900 --> 00:00:06,060
This is the login screen you see when you open ActTrader.

2
00:00:06,160 --> 00:00:11,210
Start with the Server box. This is your broker.

3
00:00:11,310 --> 00:00:14,480
Type a few letters and matching servers appear.

4
00:00:14,580 --> 00:00:18,620
Click the one your broker gave you.

5
00:00:18,720 --> 00:00:20,590
Now click the Account ID box.

6
00:00:20,690 --> 00:00:23,680
Type the account number your broker gave you.

7
00:00:23,780 --> 00:00:25,650
Then click the Password box.

8
00:00:25,750 --> 00:00:29,200
Your password stays hidden as you type.

9
00:00:29,300 --> 00:00:32,830
Tick Remember me to skip this next time.

10
00:00:32,930 --> 00:00:34,900
Now click Login.

11
00:00:35,000 --> 00:00:39,960
Your account is loading. This takes a few seconds.

12
00:00:40,060 --> 00:00:44,960
Prices and your chart are connecting.

13
00:00:45,060 --> 00:00:49,960
You are in. This is your trading workspace.

